<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Petrogal posts nine mth profit.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Petrogal posts nine mth profit.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months ending Sept 30</p>
<p>(In billions of escudos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income		 5.51   (no comparison)</p>
<p>    Turnover		 600.52   (no comparison)</p>
<p>    Cashflow		  29.27   (no comparison)</p>
<p>    Operating profit	18.61   (no comparison)</p>
<p>    Financial result     -13.24   (no comparison)</p>
<p>    Capital expenditure   18.54   (no comparison)</p>
<p>Note - State-controlled oil company Petrogal-Petroleos de Portugal gave no comparative figures for 1995.</p>
<p>Last year it made a full-year loss of 11.9 billion escudos ($77.7 million), down 367 percent on 1994's loss.</p>
<p>($1=153.16 escudos)</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
